<title>USA: CME live cattle certificates for Oct 25.</title>
<headline>CME live cattle certificates for Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the following certificates tendered for October 25 against the October Live Cattle contract.</p>
<p>Tenders 9, retenders 0, demands 9, reclaims 0. Total to date tenders and retenders 13 (tenders 11, retenders 2), demands 11, reclaims 0.</p>
<p>Oldest long - partly through Sept 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - Refco 9.</p>
<p>Received - RBH 9.</p>
<p>Delivery locations - Dodge City KS 2, Guymon OK 7.</p>
<p>Tendered at 0 cents - Dodge City 2, Guymon 7.</p>
<p>Demands at 0 cents - Dodge City 2, Guymon 7.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
